          "number": 1,
          "letter": "",
          "english": "Innovation, the elixir(灵丹妙药) of progress, has always cost people their jobs. In the Industrial Revolution hand weavers were __(26)__ aside by the mechanical loom. Over the past __(30)__ years the digital revolution has __(27)__ many of the mid-skill jobs that supported 20th-century middle-class life. Typists, ticket agents, bank tellers and many production-line jobs have been dispensed with, just as the weavers were.",
