          "number": 2,
          "letter": "",
          "english": "Unfortunately, in our western tradition, neither materialist nor idealist theoreticians give enough consideration to this basic condition for life. As for politicians, despite proposing curbs on environmental pollution, they have not yet called for it to be made a crime. Wealthy countries are even allowed to pollute if they pay for it.",
          "chinese": "遗憾的是，在我们的西方传统中，无论唯物主义理论家还是唯心主义理论家，都没有充分考虑到这一生命的基本条件。至于政治家，尽管他们提出了限制环境污染的措施，却还没有要求将污染定为犯罪。富裕国家甚至只要为污染付费，就可以获准排放污染物。",
